{"product_id":"just-your-average-muslim","title":"Just Your Average Muslim","description":"\u003cp\u003eToo often we see Islam and Muslims portrayed as fanatical jihadists or helpless victims of western oppression. This fascinating and original book provides a rare insight into what, as the book's title states, the average Muslim makes of it all. A powerful antidote to common but exhausted stereotypes, it challenges non-Muslims to reexamine their perceived ideas of what they think they know and Muslims to to examine how they portray themselves to the world. It encourages us all to reflect on our similarities, not our differences.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 128 x 196\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Zia Chaudhry\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781780722481\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45790873518233,"sku":"17RA-29781780722481","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ee188d6adf0_Just_Your_Average_Muslim_Zia_Chaudhry.jpg?v=1760460712","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/just-your-average-muslim","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}